PTX MP+rel-acq.cta+remote-shared
"As MP+rel-acq.cluster+remote-shared with .cta scope on the flag: the two CTAs are outside each other's .cta scope, so nothing synchronizes. Expected: allowed."
{
s=0 @cta 1;
f=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0     | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0  ;
 st.weak.shared::cluster s, 1 | ld.acquire.cta r0, f      ;
 st.release.cta f, 1          | ld.weak.shared::cta r1, s ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
